This product bundles or uses the following third-party material:

1. src/agent_osint/depcheck/data/slopsquatting_names.json
   Package names derived from the "Slopsquatting: Hallucination in Coding Agents and Vibe Coding" dataset,
   https://github.com/trendmicro/slopsquatting — MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Trend Micro Inc.

2. src/agent_osint/integritylens/tortured.py
   Tortured-phrase pairs from Table 1 of G. Cabanac, C. Labbé, A. Magazinov, "Tortured phrases: A dubious
   writing style emerging in science. Evidence of critical issues affecting established journals",
   arXiv:2107.06751 (2021). Short factual phrase pairs quoted for detection, with attribution.

3. tests/fixtures/crossref/*.json
   Real Crossref REST API responses captured by the citeguard project, https://github.com/wedo911/citeguard —
   MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 citeguard contributors. The underlying metadata comes from Crossref; see
   Crossref's terms (Retraction Watch data is distributed by Crossref under CC BY 4.0 per Crossref).

4. tests/fixtures/ocds_change_history/*.json
   Example releases from the Open Contracting Data Standard documentation,
   https://github.com/open-contracting/standard — Apache License 2.0, Copyright (c) 2014-2017 Open Contracting
   Partnership.

5. tests/fixtures/c2pa/*.jpg
   Test images from the c2pa-python project, https://github.com/contentauth/c2pa-python — dual licensed
   Apache License 2.0 / MIT, © Copyright 2020 Adobe.

