* hugovk/top-pypi-packages (PyPI download rankings) and wooorm/npm-high-impact (MIT) popularity lists.
* Data from Regulations.gov, Mirrulations, Crossref, OpenAlex, doi.org, PubPeer, the EU DSA Transparency
